    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        174,
        1860,
        1544,
        2244
      ],
      "category": "Text",
      "text": "As will be noted in the detailed instructions, the re-\nturn of original correspondence, as well as copies of agency's\nreply or report, will be eliminated except in special instances.\nThe procedures herein set forth were developed to give the best\npossible service to our citizens and taxpayers and the cooperation\nof all agencies is needed, expected and appreciated.",
